:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Coco (Enemy)]].''
'''Coco''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]] and can be acquired as a [[Timed Stage Reward]] when completing [[Bear's Bashfulness]] with a score of 4,500 or more during the [[LINE Pokopang! Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 421
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Coco
|name2 = Coco CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Coco CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This bear has no meaning or use in the game other than to boost [[User Rank]]. The best it can do is offer some support in early [[Empire of Cats]] stages like [[Korea (Empire of Cats)|Korea]] or [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Japan]], as it will falter and die at any real threat, like [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]]. Unfortunately, no amount of boost will save it from this fate either, as it has too low base stats.

In the best of cases, Coco may weaken a Dark enemy before dying, but it has too low base stats to survive even the softest of hits from them, so at best, he can be used as a suicidal debuffer, unless you have a rapid supply of [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] to protect him, like [[Nono (Rare Cat)|Nono]] or the [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed]] [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cats]]. Even then, it's a stiff 50/50 as for whether or not he'll debuff them, so it would be better to just invest into better attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] or [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]].

